          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations by two individuals of the silent passage of an orange-colored flying object: likely observation of a Thai lantern.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "1cdb8bcd667ce040d61202c51cfd9f30f3c1ef8d07fc6354f93e0ba687e5edfd"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
